  "body": "Discover the perfect blend of space, comfort and versatility in this beautifully updated home, offering fantastic flexibility for extended families or multi-generational split level living.\r\n\r\nFeaturing a modern kitchen, stylishly renovated bathrooms and inviting living spaces, this home has been thoughtfully updated for comfortable family living.\r\n\r\nAdding to its appeal, the downstairs area, originally designated as storage, has been converted into additional living space, complete with a separate room, living area, bathroom and kitchenette. \r\n\r\nSet on a freehold site, the property boasts expansive, private decking, perfect for entertaining family and friends, while the generous rear garden provides a wonderful space for children and pets to play. Four off-street parking spaces provide added convenience for larger families and visitors.\r\n\r\nConveniently located close to Stanmore Bay School, the beach, local shops and amenities, and just a short drive from the planned Penlink interchange.\r\n\r\nA versatile property offering space, flexibility and fantastic indoor-outdoor living in a popular coastal location.\r\n\r\nContact Sam or Mel for more information.\r\n\r\nTo view/download property files please copy this link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/F8A8\r\n\r\nAuction in rooms Manly Tuesday 15 December at 5pm (Unless Sold Prior)",
